meta {
  name: Claims platform
}

docs {
  Local API collection for the claims platform.
  Select the Local environment, then run the folder "00 Happy path" from top to bottom.
  From the command line: npx @usebruno/cli run "00 Happy path" --env Local --sandbox developer
  That folder signs in, reports a claim, and walks it through to SETTLED, then checks notifications and insights.
  The other folders cover each surface on its own: sign-in, claimant, staff, insights, templates, and the signed internal callbacks.
  Password and webhook secrets are the local seed values from deployment, not production secrets.
}
